Package: autotiss2fa
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Eren Tomurcuk <erentomurcuk@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Firefox extension for automatic TU Wien 2FA
 AutoFactorAuthenticator / AutoTISS2FA - Auto-fills TOTP codes for TU Wien login.
 The TOTP seed is stored in the system keyring (Secret Service).
 This is NOT an official tool by TU Wien.
Depends: libdbus-1-3
Recommends: zenity | kdialog
